<!--
  Connection state for the address bar. Two states, both driven by
  GeckoSession.ProgressDelegate.onSecurityChange and nothing else: there is no
  scheme sniffing and no guessing from the URL text.

  ic_https  a closed padlock, shown only when the engine reports isSecure.
  ic_http   the same padlock, open, shown when it does not.

  The colour is applied from code (tint) rather than baked in, so the
  "not secure" state can be visibly different without a third drawable.
-->
